                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The October DataFest\naimed to create awareness of open data and promote the use of the EUR Data\nRepository (EDR). </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>The DataFest was\nhosted by ERIM in collaboration with the University Library. </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>We uploaded all the\npresentations of this campaign into the EDR, here below are the links to each\nof the slides or videos (YouTube live-streams) of these sessions.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
